gnetic field can interact  and that interaction produced a  concomitant signal which was then  observed and used to infer the existence  of the interconversion between energy  photonic energy and some creation of  mass in the form of matter antimatter  pairs so when these were accelerated to  relativistic velocities their  electromagnetic fields their electric  and magnetic fields converge so this  veiled cloud of photons surrounding each  one of the gold ions as they pass  extremely close to one another those  photons interact with one another and  there's a possibility for a matter  antimatter production to occur from a  photon photon interaction of this cloud  this veil surrounding each nucleus or  each ion the researchers at rick were  able to confirm exactly this prediction  was what happened as these ions passed  close by on one another they discovered  that electrons and positrons were  ejected the implicit belief being that  this overlap of the virtual photon  fields were actually produced by the  bright wheeler process now how can you  actually confirm that it was part of  this so you have to rule out the fact  that this could be produced via other  mechanisms now what is actually  happening is whether or not these  photons are so-called real photons or  virtual photons a virtual photon is not  a photon that doesn't exist rather it's  a quantum fluctuation a transient one  that due to the famous heisenberg  uncertainty principle they're actually  well accepted in quantum field theory  especially in the work of as i mentioned  earlier richard feynman in perturbation  theory and quantum field theory and  quantum electrodynamics when you have  interactions between ordinary real  particles like electrons and positrons  you can think of them as exchanging  virtual particles and some of these  particles in the context of electron  positron scattering or pear production  can be thought of as virtual photons  these appear often in feynman diagrams  such as the one 